  "solutions": {
    "meta": {
      "title": "Pain001 适用于哪些人",
      "description": "财资、CFO 与董事会、支付运营、工程与 AI：以您的语言描述问题、Pain001 带来的改变，以及您的下一步，每个角色 150 词。",
      "eyebrow": "适用人群",
      "deck": "四种角色、四套语言、一条流水线。先找到您的问题，再找到下一步。"
    },
    "text": {
      "<a href=\"/\">Home</a>": "<a href=\"/\">首页</a>",
      "<span>Save page</span>": "<span>Save page</span>",
      "Contents": "目录",
      "<a href=\"#treasury-finance\">Treasury &amp; finance</a>": "<a href=\"#treasury-finance\">财资与财务</a>",
      "<a href=\"#cfo-board\">CFO &amp; board</a>": "<a href=\"#cfo-board\">CFO 与董事会</a>",
      "<a href=\"#payment-operations\">Payment operations</a>": "<a href=\"#payment-operations\">支付运营</a>",
      "<a href=\"#engineering-ai\">Engineering &amp; AI</a>": "<a href=\"#engineering-ai\">工程与 AI</a>",
      "Treasury &amp; finance<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#treasury-finance\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Treasury &amp; finance\">#</a>": "财资与财务<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#treasury-finance\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Treasury &amp; finance\">#</a>",
      "Your bank rejects files for reasons your ERP never warned you about: a transposed IBAN digit, a control total that no longer matches, an address format that stopped being acceptable. Pain001 makes those failures happen at your desk instead. Every file is proven against the bank's official rulebook (ISO 20022 XSD) before submission, and the <a href=\"/payments/\">payment-lifecycle guide</a> shows where each check sits between origination and reconciliation. Start with the <a href=\"/glossary/\">glossary</a> if the vocabulary is new; the plain-English definitions were written for your side of the desk, not the engineers'.": "您的银行会以 ERP 从未提醒过您的理由退回文件：IBAN 数字换位、控制总额不再匹配、地址格式不再被接受。Pain001 让这些故障提前在您的案头暴露：每个文件在提交前都依据银行的官方规则手册（ISO 20022 XSD）得到证明，<a href=\"/payments/\">支付生命周期指南</a>展示了每项检查在发起与对账之间所处的位置。如果这些术语对您还很陌生，请从<a href=\"/glossary/\">术语表</a>开始；那些通俗易懂的定义是为您这一侧的办公桌而写，而非为工程师。",
      "CFO &amp; board<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#cfo-board\" aria-label=\"Link to section: CFO &amp; board\">#</a>": "CFO 与董事会<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#cfo-board\" aria-label=\"Link to section: CFO &amp; board\">#</a>",
      "Two numbers frame the decision. <strong>By December 2026</strong>: when Swift will publish the new date for rejecting cross-border payments with unstructured addresses, a requirement it deferred in August 2026 but did not drop (<a href=\"https://www.swift.com/news-events/news/swift-accepts-community-request-extend-structured-address-migration-iso-20022-payment-messages\">Swift</a>). The exposure lives in your customer master data, not your bank connection. <strong>€10,000–30,000 per year</strong>: the public list price of the nearest commercial translation SDK, against Pain001's permanent zero at any scale under open licences. The governance questions (auditability, data locality, supply-chain evidence) are answered with artefacts, not assurances: published <a href=\"/sbom.cdx.json\">SBOM</a>, <a href=\"/security.txt\">security policy</a>, and processing that never leaves your infrastructure. The <a href=\"/executive-brief/\">one-page executive brief</a> is written to be forwarded.": "两个数字框定了这项决策。<strong>2026年12月之前</strong>：Swift 将公布拒收非结构化地址跨境支付的新日期。这项要求已于 2026年8月推迟，但并未取消（<a href=\"https://www.swift.com/news-events/news/swift-accepts-community-request-extend-structured-address-migration-iso-20022-payment-messages\">Swift</a>）。风险敞口存在于您的客户主数据中，而非您的银行连接。<strong>每年 €10,000–30,000</strong>：最接近的商业转换 SDK 的公开标价，而 Pain001 在开放许可下、任何规模均永久免费。治理问题（可审计性、数据本地性、供应链证据）以实物凭证而非口头保证作答：公开发布的 <a href=\"/sbom.cdx.json\">SBOM</a>、<a href=\"/security.txt\">安全政策</a>，以及绝不离开您基础设施的处理流程。<a href=\"/executive-brief/\">一页高管简报</a>专为转发而写。",
      "Payment operations<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#payment-operations\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Payment operations\">#</a>": "支付运营<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#payment-operations\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Payment operations\">#</a>",
      "You live in the response files. Pain001 closes the loop end to end: <code>--dry-run</code> pre-submission checks that pass or fail cleanly in CI, scheme rulebooks (SEPA and cross-border) explained rule by rule, the <a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">pain.002 reason-code reference</a> for decoding what came back, and parsers that turn bank responses and camt.053 statements into structured data your pipeline can route. The <a href=\"/try/\">browser demo</a> is the fastest way to see the failure classes it eliminates, including the one-click &quot;introduce an error&quot; scenarios.": "您的日常就在响应文件里。Pain001 端到端闭环：<code>--dry-run</code> 提交前检查在 CI 中干净地通过或失败，逐条解读的清算方案规则手册（SEPA 与跨境），用于解码回执的 <a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">pain.002 原因代码参考</a>，以及将银行响应和 camt.053 对账单转换为您的流水线可路由的结构化数据的解析器。<a href=\"/try/\">浏览器演示</a>是了解它所消除的故障类别的最快方式，其中包括一键“引入错误”场景。",
      "Engineering &amp; AI<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#engineering-ai\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Engineering &amp; AI\">#</a>": "工程与 AI<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#engineering-ai\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Engineering &amp; AI\">#</a>",
      "A typed Python API, a CLI with meaningful exit codes, a REST microservice, and plugin points for loaders, validators, schemes, and writers. <a href=\"/documentation/\">The technical reference</a> covers every flag and endpoint, and the code carries 100% line-and-branch coverage as a hard CI gate. If you are building with agents: <a href=\"/pain001-mcp/\">pain001-mcp</a> is the category's only Model Context Protocol server, with seventeen read-only tools your agents call locally, with editor diagnostics from <a href=\"/pain001-lsp/\">pain001-lsp</a> while humans stay in the loop.": "类型化的 Python API、带有明确退出码的 CLI、REST 微服务，以及面向加载器、校验器、清算方案和写入器的插件点。<a href=\"/documentation/\">技术参考</a>覆盖每一个标志与端点，代码以 100% 行与分支覆盖率作为硬性 CI 门槛。如果您在构建智能体：<a href=\"/pain001-mcp/\">pain001-mcp</a> 是该类别中唯一的 Model Context Protocol 服务器：十七个只读工具供您的智能体在本地调用，并由 <a href=\"/pain001-lsp/\">pain001-lsp</a> 提供编辑器诊断，同时人类始终在环。"
    },
