    "text": {
      "<a href=\"/\">Home</a>": "<a href=\"/\">首页</a>",
      "<span>Save page</span>": "<span>Save page</span>",
      "Contents": "目录",
      "<a href=\"#the-problem\">The problem</a>": "<a href=\"#the-problem\">问题</a>",
      "<a href=\"#the-deadline\">The deadline</a>": "<a href=\"#the-deadline\">期限</a>",
      "<a href=\"#what-pain001-does\">What Pain001 does</a>": "<a href=\"#what-pain001-does\">Pain001 的作用</a>",
      "<a href=\"#what-it-costs\">What it costs</a>": "<a href=\"#what-it-costs\">成本</a>",
      "<a href=\"#the-evidence\">The evidence</a>": "<a href=\"#the-evidence\">证据</a>",
      "<a href=\"#the-ask\">The ask</a>": "<a href=\"#the-ask\">请求</a>",
      "<strong>To print or save as PDF:</strong> use your browser's print function (⌘P / Ctrl+P). This page carries a print stylesheet that produces a clean single page, with no navigation, no footer, and links written out in full.": "<strong>如需打印或另存为 PDF：</strong>请使用浏览器的打印功能（⌘P / Ctrl+P）。本页附带打印样式表，可生成干净的单页：没有导航、没有页脚，链接完整写出。",
      "Read in: <a href=\"/fr/executive-brief/\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/de/executive-brief/\">Deutsch</a> · <a href=\"/es/executive-brief/\">Español</a>": "其他语言：<a href=\"/fr/executive-brief/\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/de/executive-brief/\">Deutsch</a> · <a href=\"/es/executive-brief/\">Español</a>",
      "The problem<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-problem\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The problem\">#</a>": "问题<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-problem\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The problem\">#</a>",
      "Banks reject malformed payment files. Every rejection costs a repair cycle; a repair that misses the day's cut-off costs a settlement day. The rejection reasons are knowable in advance, and therefore preventable.": "银行会退回格式错误的支付文件。每次退回都要付出一个修复周期；错过当日截止时间的修复则要付出一个结算日。退回原因可以事先知晓，因此可以预防。",
      "The deadline<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-deadline\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The deadline\">#</a>": "期限<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-deadline\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The deadline\">#</a>",
      "<strong>Deferred, not dropped.</strong> In August 2026 Swift postponed the rule that rejects cross-border payments (CBPR+) with fully unstructured addresses, and the move from interbank MT101 to ISO 20022 <code>pain.001</code> version 9. The new timing comes by December 2026. The exposure still sits in customer master data, and dates already set remain: June 2027 (investigations), November 2027 (CHAPS purpose codes), November 2028 (MT statements). Sources: Swift and central banks, cited in full at pain001.com/2026-iso20022-migration-trends.": "<strong>推迟，而非取消。</strong>2026年8月，Swift 推迟了拒收带有完全非结构化地址的跨境支付（CBPR+）的规则，以及银行间 MT101 迁移到 ISO 20022 <code>pain.001</code> 第 9 版的变更。新的时间安排将于 2026年12月之前公布。风险敞口仍位于客户主数据之中，已确定的日期保持不变：2027年6月（调查类报文）、2027年11月（CHAPS 用途代码）、2028年11月（MT 对账单）。来源：Swift 及各国央行，完整引用见 pain001.com/2026-iso20022-migration-trends。",
      "What Pain001 does<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-pain001-does\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What Pain001 does\">#</a>": "Pain001 的作用<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-pain001-does\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What Pain001 does\">#</a>",
      "An open-source suite that converts existing data (spreadsheets, ERP exports, legacy SWIFT files) into bank-ready ISO 20022 payment files, and proves each file against the bank's official rulebook (ISO 20022 XSD) <em>before</em> submission. It runs entirely on your own infrastructure: no upload, no vendor cloud, no telemetry.": "一套开源套件，将现有数据（电子表格、ERP 导出文件、传统 SWIFT 文件）转换为可直接提交银行的 ISO 20022 支付文件，并在提交<em>之前</em>依据银行的官方规则手册（ISO 20022 XSD）证明每个文件。它完全运行在您自己的基础设施上：不上传、无供应商云、无遥测。",
      "What it costs<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-it-costs\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What it costs\">#</a>": "成本<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-it-costs\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What it costs\">#</a>",
      "Nothing, at any scale, under open licences (Apache-2.0 / MIT). Commercial reference point: SWIFT's translation SDK is publicly listed at €10,000–30,000 per year.": "零成本，任何规模，基于开放许可（Apache-2.0 / MIT）。商业参照：SWIFT 的转换 SDK 公开标价为每年 €10,000–30,000。",
      "Support, an LTS line and private profile work for your bank's guideline are offered separately, without changing the licences: <a href=\"/enterprise/\">enterprise page</a>.": "支持、LTS 版本线以及按贵行指南进行的私有配置工作单独提供，许可证不变：<a href=\"/enterprise/\">企业页面</a>。",
      "The evidence<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-evidence\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The evidence\">#</a>": "证据<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-evidence\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The evidence\">#</a>",
      "Published dependency inventory (SBOM) · 100% branch-covered code as a CI gate · independently scored supply chain (OpenSSF Scorecard) · WCAG 2.2 AAA accessible documentation · security policy with private disclosure. All verifiable at pain001.com.": "公开发布的依赖项清单（SBOM）· 以 100% 分支覆盖率作为 CI 门槛的代码 · 独立评分的供应链（OpenSSF Scorecard）· 符合 WCAG 2.2 AAA 无障碍标准的文档 · 支持私密披露的安全政策。均可在 pain001.com 上核验。",
      "The ask<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-ask\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The ask\">#</a>": "请求<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-ask\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The ask\">#</a>",
      "Have your payments engineering team run the 60-second demo at <strong>pain001.com/try</strong>. It validates a sample batch and proves it against the official ISO 20022 schema, in the browser, with nothing uploaded. If it holds up, the installation guide takes minutes.": "请您的支付工程团队在 <strong>pain001.com/try</strong> 运行 60 秒演示。它在浏览器中校验一个样本批次，并依据官方 ISO 20022 模式加以证明，任何数据都不会被上传。如果经得住检验，安装指南只需几分钟。"
    },
