  "pain-001": {
    "meta": {
      "title": "什么是 pain.001？ISO 20022 贷记转账发起报文",
      "description": "pain.001 是企业向银行发送、用于发起贷记转账的 ISO 20022 XML 报文。本文介绍其结构、.03 至 .13 各版本、一个经过验证的示例，以及它与 pain.002、pain.008、pacs.008 和 MT101 的区别。",
      "eyebrow": "ISO 20022 详解",
      "deck": "企业向开户银行发送、用于发起贷记转账的 ISO 20022 报文：它是什么、如何构成、应使用哪个版本，以及一个可通过官方模式校验的完整示例。"
    },
    "text": {
      "<a href=\"/\">Home</a>": "<a href=\"/\">首页</a>",
      "ISO 20022 explained": "ISO 20022 详解",
      "The ISO 20022 message a company sends its bank to order credit transfers: what it is, how it is built, which version to use, and a complete example that validates against the official schema.": "企业向银行发送、用于发起贷记转账的 ISO 20022 报文：它是什么、如何构成、应使用哪个版本，并附一个可通过官方模式验证的完整示例。",
      "<span>Save page</span>": "<span>Save page</span>",
      "Contents": "目录",
      "<a href=\"#pain-001-in-one-minute\">pain.001 in one minute</a>": "<a href=\"#pain-001-in-one-minute\">一分钟了解 pain.001</a>",
      "<a href=\"#how-a-pain-001-message-is-structured\">How a pain.001 message is structured</a>": "<a href=\"#how-a-pain-001-message-is-structured\">pain.001 报文的结构</a>",
      "<a href=\"#a-complete-pain-001-example\">A complete pain.001 example</a>": "<a href=\"#a-complete-pain-001-example\">完整的 pain.001 示例</a>",
      "<a href=\"#pain-001-versions\">pain.001 versions</a>": "<a href=\"#pain-001-versions\">pain.001 的版本</a>",
      "<a href=\"#pain-001-compared-with-related-messages\">pain.001 compared with related messages</a>": "<a href=\"#pain-001-compared-with-related-messages\">pain.001 与相关报文的比较</a>",
      "<a href=\"#why-banks-reject-pain-001-files\">Why banks reject pain.001 files</a>": "<a href=\"#why-banks-reject-pain-001-files\">银行为何退回 pain.001 文件</a>",
      "<a href=\"#how-to-create-a-pain-001-file\">How to create a pain.001 file</a>": "<a href=\"#how-to-create-a-pain-001-file\">如何创建 pain.001 文件</a>",
      "<a href=\"#sources\">Sources</a>": "<a href=\"#sources\">资料来源</a>",
      "<strong>pain.001</strong> is the ISO 20022 message a company sends its bank to order one or more credit transfers. Its full name is <em>Customer Credit Transfer Initiation</em>: &quot;pain&quot; is the payment initiation message family, <code>.001</code> is the message number, and the suffix, such as <code>pain.001.001.09</code>, is the version. It is XML, it is validated against an official schema (XSD), and it replaces bank-specific CSV formats and the SWIFT MT101 text message.": "<strong>pain.001</strong> 是企业向其银行发送、用于发起一笔或多笔贷记转账的 ISO 20022 报文。其全称为 <em>Customer Credit Transfer Initiation</em>（客户贷记转账发起）：&quot;pain&quot; 表示支付发起报文系列，<code>.001</code> 是报文编号，后缀（如 <code>pain.001.001.09</code>）表示版本。它采用 XML 格式，依据官方模式（XSD）进行验证，并取代各银行自定义的 CSV 格式和 SWIFT MT101 文本报文。",
      "pain.001 in one minute<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-in-one-minute\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 in one minute\">#</a>": "一分钟了解 pain.001<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-in-one-minute\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 in one minute\">#</a>",
      "<strong>Who sends it:</strong> a company (the debtor, or an agent acting for it) sends it to its own bank (the debtor agent).": "<strong>由谁发送：</strong>企业（付款人，或代表其行事的代理方）将其发送给自己的银行（付款人代理行）。",
      "<strong>What it carries:</strong> one or more batches of credit transfers, each with a debtor account, a requested execution date and any number of payments to creditors.": "<strong>包含什么：</strong>一个或多个贷记转账批次，每个批次包含一个付款人账户、一个指定执行日期以及任意数量的收款人付款。",
      "<strong>What comes back:</strong> the bank answers with <strong>pain.002</strong>, the Customer Payment Status Report, accepting or rejecting the file or individual transactions with ISO reason codes.": "<strong>返回什么：</strong>银行以 <strong>pain.002</strong>（客户支付状态报告）作答，使用 ISO 原因代码接受或拒绝整个文件或单笔交易。",
      "<strong>What happens next:</strong> once accepted, the bank turns each instruction into interbank messages such as <strong>pacs.008</strong>, which the company never sees.": "<strong>之后发生什么：</strong>一旦受理，银行会将每条指令转换为 <strong>pacs.008</strong> 等银行间报文，企业不会看到这些报文。",
      "<strong>Where it is used:</strong> SEPA credit transfers under the EPC rulebooks, cross-border payments on Swift under CBPR+ (<code>pain.001.001.09</code>), and many domestic schemes. Pain001's <a href=\"/example-corpus/\">example corpus</a> covers 42 scenarios across 17 markets.": "<strong>使用场景：</strong>遵循 EPC 规则手册的 SEPA 贷记转账、在 Swift 上遵循 CBPR+ 的跨境支付（<code>pain.001.001.09</code>）以及众多国内支付体系。Pain001 的<a href=\"/example-corpus/\">示例语料库</a>覆盖 17 个市场的 42 个场景。",
      "How a pain.001 message is structured<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#how-a-pain-001-message-is-structured\" aria-label=\"Link to section: How a pain.001 message is structured\">#</a>": "pain.001 报文的结构<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#how-a-pain-001-message-is-structured\" aria-label=\"Link to section: How a pain.001 message is structured\">#</a>",
      "Every version shares the same three-level skeleton inside a <code>&lt;CstmrCdtTrfInitn&gt;</code> element.": "所有版本在 <code>&lt;CstmrCdtTrfInitn&gt;</code> 元素内都采用相同的三层骨架。",
      "Level": "层级",
      "Element": "元素",
      "What it holds": "包含内容",
      "<code>&lt;GrpHdr&gt;</code> Group Header": "<code>&lt;GrpHdr&gt;</code> 组头",
      "Message ID, creation timestamp, number of transactions (<code>NbOfTxs</code>), control sum (<code>CtrlSum</code>), initiating party": "报文 ID、创建时间戳、交易笔数（<code>NbOfTxs</code>）、控制总额（<code>CtrlSum</code>）、发起方",
      "<code>&lt;PmtInf&gt;</code> Payment Information": "<code>&lt;PmtInf&gt;</code> 支付信息",
      "One batch: payment method, requested execution date, debtor, debtor account and agent, charge bearer": "一个批次：支付方式、指定执行日期、付款人、付款人账户及代理行、费用承担方",
      "<code>&lt;CdtTrfTxInf&gt;</code> Credit Transfer Transaction": "<code>&lt;CdtTrfTxInf&gt;</code> 贷记转账交易",
      "One payment: end-to-end reference, amount and currency, creditor, creditor account and agent, remittance information": "一笔付款：端到端参考号、金额与币种、收款人、收款人账户及代理行、汇款信息",
      "A file can hold several <code>&lt;PmtInf&gt;</code> batches, and each batch many <code>&lt;CdtTrfTxInf&gt;</code> payments. <code>NbOfTxs</code> and <code>CtrlSum</code> appear at both the file and the batch level and must match the payments they count, which is one of the most common reasons a bank rejects a file.": "一个文件可以包含多个 <code>&lt;PmtInf&gt;</code> 批次，每个批次可包含多笔 <code>&lt;CdtTrfTxInf&gt;</code> 付款。<code>NbOfTxs</code> 和 <code>CtrlSum</code> 同时出现在文件级和批次级，必须与其统计的付款相符，这是银行退回文件最常见的原因之一。",
      "A complete pain.001 example<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#a-complete-pain-001-example\" aria-label=\"Link to section: A complete pain.001 example\">#</a>": "完整的 pain.001 示例<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#a-complete-pain-001-example\" aria-label=\"Link to section: A complete pain.001 example\">#</a>",
      "This is a single SEPA credit transfer in <code>pain.001.001.09</code>, taken unchanged from Pain001's <a href=\"/corpus-it-sepa-sct-single/\">example corpus</a>. It validates against the official ISO 20022 XSD. The parties, IBANs and BICs are fictitious.": "这是一笔 <code>pain.001.001.09</code> 格式的 SEPA 贷记转账，原样取自 Pain001 的<a href=\"/corpus-it-sepa-sct-single/\">示例语料库</a>。它可通过官方 ISO 20022 XSD 验证。其中的当事方、IBAN 和 BIC 均为虚构。",
      "Try your own data in the <a href=\"/try/\">browser demo</a>: it builds a pain.001 file from a CSV and validates it against the official schema without the data leaving your machine.": "在<a href=\"/try/\">浏览器演示</a>中试用您自己的数据：它从 CSV 生成 pain.001 文件并依据官方模式进行验证，数据不会离开您的设备。",
      "pain.001 versions<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-versions\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 versions\">#</a>": "pain.001 的版本<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-versions\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 versions\">#</a>",
      "ISO publishes a new version when the message model changes. Banks and schemes each accept particular versions, so the version you send is the one your bank's channel documentation names.": "当报文模型发生变化时，ISO 会发布新版本。各银行和支付体系只接受特定版本，因此您发送的版本应以银行渠道文档中指定的为准。",
      "Version": "版本",
      "Notes": "说明",
      "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.03/\">pain.001.001.03</a>": "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.03/\">pain.001.001.03</a>",
      "The long-standing SEPA and CGI workhorse; identifies banks with <code>&lt;BIC&gt;</code>": "长期以来 SEPA 和 CGI 的主力版本；使用 <code>&lt;BIC&gt;</code> 标识银行",
      "Maintenance versions used by particular channels": "特定渠道使用的维护版本",
      "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.09/\">pain.001.001.09</a>": "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.09/\">pain.001.001.09</a>",
      "The 2019 version CBPR+ selected for Swift; identifies banks with <code>&lt;BICFI&gt;</code>, adds LEI and UETR carriage": "CBPR+ 为 Swift 选定的 2019 年版本；使用 <code>&lt;BICFI&gt;</code> 标识银行，并支持携带 LEI 和 UETR",
      "Post-2019 refinements": "2019 年之后的改进版本",
      "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.13/\">pain.001.001.13</a>": "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.13/\">pain.001.001.13</a>",
      "Published by ISO on 19 March 2026; adds an optional unique transaction identifier (<code>UnqTxIdr</code>)": "ISO 于 2026 年 3 月 19 日发布；新增可选的唯一交易标识符（<code>UnqTxIdr</code>）",
      "The <a href=\"/compatibility/\">compatibility matrix</a> shows which versions Pain001 generates, validates and migrates between.": "<a href=\"/compatibility/\">兼容性矩阵</a>列出了 Pain001 可生成、验证及相互迁移的版本。",
      "pain.001 compared with related messages<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-compared-with-related-messages\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 compared with related messages\">#</a>": "pain.001 与相关报文的比较<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-compared-with-related-messages\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 compared with related messages\">#</a>",
      "Message": "报文",
      "Direction": "方向",
      "Purpose": "用途",
      "<strong>pain.001</strong>": "<strong>pain.001</strong>",
      "Company to its bank": "企业发往其银行",
      "Orders credit transfers (pushes money out)": "发起贷记转账（向外付款）",
      "<strong>pain.002</strong>": "<strong>pain.002</strong>",
      "Bank to company": "银行发往企业",
      "Reports the status of a pain.001 or pain.008: accepted, partially accepted or rejected, with <a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">reason codes</a>": "报告 pain.001 或 pain.008 的状态：已接受、部分接受或已拒绝，并附<a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">原因代码</a>",
      "<strong>pain.008</strong>": "<strong>pain.008</strong>",
      "Orders direct debits (collects money under a mandate)": "发起直接借记（依据授权收款）",
      "<strong>pacs.008</strong>": "<strong>pacs.008</strong>",
      "Bank to bank": "银行之间",
      "The interbank credit transfer a pain.001 instruction becomes": "pain.001 指令转换而成的银行间贷记转账",
      "Company or bank, over Swift": "企业或银行，经由 Swift",
      "The legacy text &quot;Request for Transfer&quot; that pain.001 replaces. Swift deferred the retirement of the interbank MT101 relay in August 2026 (<a href=\"https://www.swift.com/news-events/news/swift-accepts-community-request-extend-structured-address-migration-iso-20022-payment-messages\">Swift</a>); see <a href=\"/pain001-loader-mt101/\">MT101 to pain.001</a>": "被 pain.001 取代的传统文本报文 &quot;Request for Transfer&quot;。Swift 于 2026 年 8 月推迟了银行间 MT101 中转的停用（<a href=\"https://www.swift.com/news-events/news/swift-accepts-community-request-extend-structured-address-migration-iso-20022-payment-messages\">Swift</a>）；参见<a href=\"/pain001-loader-mt101/\">从 MT101 到 pain.001</a>",
      "The <a href=\"/glossary/\">glossary</a> defines the rest of the ISO 20022 vocabulary in plain English.": "<a href=\"/glossary/\">术语表</a>以通俗语言解释了其余的 ISO 20022 术语。",
      "Why banks reject pain.001 files<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#why-banks-reject-pain-001-files\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Why banks reject pain.001 files\">#</a>": "银行为何退回 pain.001 文件<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#why-banks-reject-pain-001-files\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Why banks reject pain.001 files\">#</a>",
      "A file can be well-formed XML and still be rejected. The checks stack up in layers:": "文件即使是格式正确的 XML，仍可能被退回。检查按层级逐层进行：",
      "<strong>Schema:</strong> the file must validate against the official XSD for its version.": "<strong>模式：</strong>文件必须通过其版本对应的官方 XSD 验证。",
      "<strong>Data quality:</strong> IBANs pass their check digits, BICs are well formed, dates and amounts are valid, and <code>NbOfTxs</code> and <code>CtrlSum</code> match the payments.": "<strong>数据质量：</strong>IBAN 通过校验位检查，BIC 格式正确，日期和金额有效，<code>NbOfTxs</code> 和 <code>CtrlSum</code> 与付款相符。",
      "<strong>Scheme rules:</strong> SEPA, CBPR+ and domestic schemes add their own constraints, such as the allowed character set or a structured postal address.": "<strong>支付体系规则：</strong>SEPA、CBPR+ 及国内支付体系会附加各自的约束，例如允许的字符集或结构化邮政地址。",
      "<strong>Your bank's profile and channel:</strong> each bank publishes its own usage guidelines on top of the scheme.": "<strong>您银行的配置与渠道：</strong>每家银行都会在支付体系之上发布自己的使用指南。",
      "Pain001 checks the first three layers before the file reaches the bank and states plainly that the fourth is the bank's to confirm.": "Pain001 在文件送达银行之前检查前三层，并明确说明第四层需由银行确认。",
      "How to create a pain.001 file<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#how-to-create-a-pain-001-file\" aria-label=\"Link to section: How to create a pain.001 file\">#</a>": "如何创建 pain.001 文件<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#how-to-create-a-pain-001-file\" aria-label=\"Link to section: How to create a pain.001 file\">#</a>",
      "<strong>From a spreadsheet:</strong> <a href=\"/excel-to-pain001/\">Excel to pain.001</a> turns an Excel or CSV payment list into a validated file.": "<strong>通过电子表格：</strong><a href=\"/excel-to-pain001/\">从 Excel 到 pain.001</a> 可将 Excel 或 CSV 付款清单转换为经过验证的文件。",
      "<strong>In the browser:</strong> the <a href=\"/try/\">demo</a> generates and validates a file locally, with no upload.": "<strong>在浏览器中：</strong><a href=\"/try/\">演示</a>在本地生成并验证文件，无需上传。",
      "<strong>From code or the command line:</strong> install the open-source <a href=\"/installation/\">pain001 library</a> and run:": "<strong>通过代码或命令行：</strong>安装开源的 <a href=\"/installation/\">pain001 库</a>并运行：",
      "The <a href=\"/documentation/\">technical reference</a> covers every option, and the <a href=\"/faqs/\">FAQs</a> answer the questions treasury, operations and engineering teams ask most.": "<a href=\"/documentation/\">技术参考</a>涵盖所有选项，<a href=\"/faqs/\">常见问题</a>解答了财资、运营和工程团队最常提出的问题。",
